{
  "info": {
    "name": "HRIS API",
    "description": "Koleksi endpoint API HRIS untuk pengujian.\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Import file ini dan file `hris-postman-environment.json` ke Postman\n2. Pilih environment \"HRIS Local\"\n3. Jalankan request \"Login\" di folder Auth — token akan otomatis tersimpan ke variabel `token`\n4. Semua request lain sudah menggunakan Bearer Token `{{token}}`\n\nDefault credentials:\n- Super Admin: EMP-20220101-001 / admin123\n- System Admin: EMP-20220501-005 / admin123\n- HRD: EMP-20220201-002 / admin123\n- Finance: EMP-20220301-003 / admin123\n- Manager: EMP-20220401-004 / admin123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "employeeId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "runId", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "leaveId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Super Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nik\": \"EMP-20220101-001\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('employeeId', json.employeeId);",
                  "  console.log('Token saved for role:', json.role);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
